                  <p className="text-sm md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-700">
                    The process of enrolling in a program requires systematic execution. Skipping steps or rushing into an agreement without due diligence can lead to further financial complications. The following is a comprehensive step checklist designed to ensure you transition smoothly into a legitimate and effective debt management program.
                  </p>

